WEBVTT

NOTE
This is the Dollet SeeD Field Exam beach landing sequence.
A major action FMV showing SeeD candidates landing on Dollet beach under fire.
Duration: approximately 1 minute 18 seconds.

00:00.000 --> 00:08.000
Multiple armored SeeD landing craft speed across the ocean toward the town of Dollet. The vessels are large, military-grade boats with angular, functional designs. The sky above transitions from bright blue to rich orange and red hues as the sun approaches the horizon. The water's surface reflects these warm colors, creating a striking contrast between the silvery metal of the boats and the vibrant sunset backdrop.

00:08.000 --> 00:18.000
Several landing craft race forward in formation, their powerful engines churning the water behind them into white foam. The ocean stretches endlessly in all directions. The distant silhouette of Dollet's coastline becomes visible ahead. The camera captures the raw speed and purpose of the SeeD military operation. The sunset casts long shadows across the decks of the vessels.

00:18.000 --> 00:28.000
The boats approach the sandy Dollet beach. The town's buildings and structures become visible beyond the shoreline. The Communication Tower stands prominently on the cliffs above, a large structure with a distinctive satellite dish on top. The SeeD landing craft cut through the water with determination. The beach itself shows golden sand and shallow waters where the boats will make their approach.

00:28.000 --> 00:38.000
The first landing craft reach the beach. The metal ramps at the front of each boat lower with mechanical force, creating an opening onto the sand. SeeD candidates — young soldiers wearing dark military uniforms and carrying weapons — pour out rapidly from the vessels. They splash through the shallow water and charge up onto the sandy beach.

00:38.000 --> 00:48.000
More waves of SeeD candidates disembark from multiple boats. Squall, identifiable by his distinctive gunblade and dark hair, runs across the beach. Zell Dincht, a younger cadet with distinctive facial features, charges alongside other soldiers. Seifer Almasy, a confident figure in his SeeD uniform, leads the charge forward up the beach with commanding presence. Dozens of soldiers spread out across the sand in tactical formation.

00:48.000 --> 00:58.000
In the distance, combat is erupting in Dollet. Orange flashes of explosions light up the town's buildings and streets. Galbadian occupation forces are engaging the SeeD candidates. The sounds of distant gunfire and explosions underscore the danger of the mission. The Communication Tower looms larger as the candidates advance toward the town.

00:58.000 --> 01:08.000
Seifer leads the charge toward the town with aggressive forward momentum. The beach is now filled with SeeD soldiers running in organized squads toward their objectives. The sunset sky continues to glow with warm orange and red light. Smoke begins to rise from various points in Dollet as combat intensifies. The scale of the military operation becomes apparent with dozens of soldiers in motion.

01:08.000 --> 01:18.000
The final moments show the SeeD candidates advancing off the beach toward the town proper. The Communication Tower is clearly visible on the elevated terrain above. More explosions erupt in the distance as Galbadian forces resist the invasion. The candidates move with military precision despite the chaos. The scene ends with the soldiers disappearing into the streets and buildings of Dollet, ready for combat.
